n":"carsonetb","id":63245844,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzMjQ1ODQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63245844?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/carsonetb","html_url":"https://github.com/carsonetb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carsonetb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carsonetb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carsonetb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carsonetb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carsonetb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carsonetb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carsonetb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carsonetb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carsonetb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-23T00:27:07Z","updated_at":"2024-11-23T03:53:17Z","body":"Sorry for the late reply, I've been working on other things. Two things that might be helpful to make sure that we have the same setup is A) the exact command you're using to compile Godot and B) A zip containing all of the files in your custom module folder.\n\nFor example, here's mine. Do you see anything that looks different from yours?\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/11db7846-77de-4081-a31f-629b7a2100fc)\n\nAnd below is my register_types code:\n\n```\n#include \"register_types.h\"\n\n#include \"core/object/class_db.h\"\n#include \"parent_class.h\"\n#include \"derived_class.h\"\n\nvoid initialize_inheritance_bug_module(ModuleInitializationLevel p_level) {\n\tif (p_level != MODULE_INITIALIZATION_LEVEL_SCENE) {\n\t\treturn;\n\t}\n\tClassDB::register_class<ParentClass>();\n    ClassDB::register_class<DerivedClass>();\n}\n\nvoid uninitialize_inheritance_bug_module(ModuleInitializationLevel p_level) {\n\tif (p_level != MODULE_INITIALIZATION_LEVEL_SCENE) {\n\t\treturn;\n\t}\n}\n```\n\nThis is all just following the [custom modules tutorial](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/contributing/development/core_and_modules/custom_modules_in_cpp.html) from the Godot documentation.\n\nLet me know if you did anything different!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2495143524/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]